Source: supermox-tmpfiles
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: SuperMox <noreply@supermox.me>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: supermox-tmpfiles
Architecture: all
Provides: systemd-tmpfiles
Conflicts: systemd-standalone-tmpfiles
Description: tmpfiles.d processor for sysvinit systems
  SuperMox's replacement for systemd-standalone-tmpfiles. It ships
  /usr/bin/systemd-tmpfiles as a POSIX sh script that implements the
  tmpfiles.d line types needed by the PVE stack (d D v q Q f F L z Z r R)
  for --create, --remove and --boot. It satisfies the "systemd-tmpfiles"
  virtual package that debhelper's dh_installtmpfiles adds as a dependency
  of packages shipping debian/tmpfiles, without pulling in any systemd
  code.
